contentText:
Texas forever. Ella Langley&#8217;s &#8220;Choosin&#8217; Texas&#8221; smash notched a 23rd week atop the Billboard Hot 100 on Tuesday (Sept. 22), and the country star celebrated breaking the record for having the the most weeks at No. 1 on the U.S. chart with a heartfelt video posted to Instagram thanking her fans.

